{
  "description": "Locked test vectors for FCMP++ witness header round-trip. The 288-byte header layout is [O:32][I:32][C:32][CM:32][r:32][x:32][y:32][z:32][a:32] (PL-D3: CM is the input's PQC leaf commitment point, r its blind; both replace the former h_pqc field \u2014 docs/design/FCMP_SPEND_LINKABILITY.md \u00a76.2). Written via shekyl_fcmp_build_witness_header and parsed via parse_prove_witness, both Rust and both gated on feature=multisig; the C++ declarations were deleted with the legacy prove seam. Layout-only: the field bytes are patterns, not valid points or scalars. Any change to this file is a format change of the multisig witness seam.",
